<p>The <strong class="selflink">JobBoardPlots 2da</strong> controls all of the jobs (<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Plot" title="Plot">plots</a>) that can be displayed on a <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Job%20board" title="Job board">job board</a>.
</p><p>This <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/2DA" title="2da">2da</a> file is defined as an <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2da" title="M2da (page does not exist)">m2da</a> and has an <b>ID</b> of <b>116</b> in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/M2DA%20base%202da" title="M2DA base 2da">M2DA_base 2da</a> and can be extended by m2da fragments which have names starting with <b>JobBoardPlots</b>. 
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Structure">Structure</span></h2>
