</td>
<td>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th>  PlotRef
</th>
<td align="center"> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Resource%20%282da%20type%29" title="Resource (2da type)"> resource</a>
</td>
<td>  The plot resource that this particular entry belongs to.
</td></tr>
<tr>
<th>  BoardId
</th>
<td align="center"> <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20%282da%20type%29" title="Int (2da type)"> int</a>
</td>
<td>  The job board's ID number corresponds to row ID of its entry in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/JobBoards%202da" title="JobBoards 2da">JobBoards 2da</a>.
</td></tr>
<tr>
