</td>
<td>  A plot flag number from the plot resource  referenced in the PlotRef column. When this plot flag is <i>set</i> the job will be displayed on the Job Board. The job's title will be the plot resource's <b>Name</b> property. When the player clicks on the job's title this plot flag's <b>Journal Text</b> is displayed.
</td></tr>
